## Interface: 16001
## Title: Gamepad Camera Offset
## Notes: Moves the camera over your shoulder and up, with a controller too. Hold a key and drag, or push the left stick, to slide it from shoulder to shoulder. Settings in Options > AddOns > Gamepad Camera Offset, or /gpco.
